# Low-power hidden-service profile for a private Prysm relay: no proof-of-work
# defenses (they cost CPU to the service itself), cheap intro DoS defense on.
# For a public relay under attack, see the "public hardening" profile in
# packages/prysm_relay_server/README.md ("Tor runbook").
SocksPort 0
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/prysm-relay
HiddenServicePort 80 127.0.0.1:8443
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSDefense 1
HiddenServiceMaxStreams 32
Log notice stdout
